{"c":[{"name":"20261016T215531Z-cabd5aa56838fc34","text":"shim _alive: only ENOENT/ENOTDIR/ELOOP mean a baked engine is dead; other stat errors (EACCES, ESTALE) count as alive, so rectify leaves it. Do not use Path.is_file: it raises those before Python 3.14 and returns False from 3.14.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261016T222048Z-5c4cd091dd70b15f","text":"Design rule (operator, 2026-10-16): fixes for Claude Code-only problems must not add questions for Cursor users. sr-initialize asks the user only in Claude Code; Cursor keeps its own evidence (CURSOR_PLUGIN_ROOT).","type":"note"}]}
